! mcp_bootstrap_p334.strap -- MCP printed page 334: the LOADER's reject
! exits (YSUKFX, YLERR, YAERR2, YAERR1, YLERR2 .. YLJL), the reject
! message texts (YLEM1, YMLJM, YLJM1, the error-text table, YSUKM), the
! disk fetch buffer CDSKBF DRZ(N),(512) and ZFINIS VF,0, lines 1-54.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.84, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22LOADER  CARD
! ID TB000085  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 334"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field is BLANK (line 1 is a remark card).
!
! THE PAGE.  54 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.  Lines
! 1-4 are remark cards (a "*" banner, "LOADER REJECT - (YLERR2 - YLERR
! IS CASE WHERE BRANCH CARD IS MISSING ) - USE RETURN TO DIAGNOSE ERROR
! AND GOTO YBRLOG", a "*" banner), no location.  Located rows run
! contiguous from 235345.40 (line 5) to 236464.00 (line 54, ZFINIS VF,0;
! a half word, next 236464.40).  "*" after the LOCATION on lines 12, 29,
! 40, 42, 45, 48, 51, 53.  No TAIL card.
!
! JOIN.  p.333 (scratch neighbour, not landed) ends with B,ARNRM5 at
! 235345.00 (a half word): contiguous with line 5.  p.332 (scratch)
! stands in YSUKFX 235345.40, YLERR 235346.40, YLERR2 235356.00 -- all
! three are this page's printed locations.  CDSKBF at 235464.00 is the
! address every landed stand-in (pp.311-317) uses; ZFINIS at 236464.00
! is landed p.103's stand-in.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * B,YRLLOG (lines 6, 11, 37): lines 6 and 37 print a CLOSED O at
!     900 dpi (line 11 prints it open).  Written YRLLOG.  NOTE: scratch
!     p.333 DEFINES this label as "YRLLCG" (line 6, 235326.40); the ink
!     here says YRLLOG -- the two must be reconciled.
!   * "$1C" (lines 5, 10, 36) = $10: the binary 235454.25/235374.25/
!     235404.25 is what LVI,$10 assembles.
!   * line 22 "(2)0000101C": the last glyph is in a binary literal, so
!     0 -- (2)00001010; the binary 024000.00 is 00001010 left-justified.
!   * hex bytes printed with open rounds ("C1" line 26, "C0" line 16,
!     ".CC"/".C0" octal fields) read 0 where the statement can only
!     assemble 0; line 21's BZRZ byte C0 is a real C0 (as p.328's BZRZ).
!   * line 28 "ALD BF" (a gap in the ink) = ALDBF (landed p.291 line 33).
!   * line 53 "CDSKBF" prints its D worn ("CUSKBF" to Vision): C22-6728
!     names CDSKBF, the disk fetch buffer.
!   * the (AX)DD texts: blank counts measured on a 40.07 px/column grid
!     against the X terminator (column 43 = 32 characters, each text's
!     4-word stride confirms it); line 52's X stands in column 25, 14
!     blanks; line 51's 49 characters give 235462.10 exactly.
!     "CRIGIN" = ORIGIN (English, lines 49, 50).
!
! EXTERNALS.  KSILO (p.171), ABSSID / ARCDCT / ALDBF (p.291), SCA8
! (p.261), ARNORM (p.326) are landed; forms copied.  YRLLOG is scratch
! p.333's label; YLJSLT is scratch p.332's VF.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  TB000085 .. TB000136 (lines 1-52), then TC000001,
! TC000002 (lines 53, 54): a new card-deck series begins at CDSKBF.

KSILO   SYN(BU,64), (8)220451.0      ! landed p.171 DR(BU,64),(K QUANT) at 220451.00; L line 7 KSILO+2.
ABSSID  SYN, (8)232542.0             ! landed p.291 line 8 (A*)DD(BU,48,6); as p.271 writes it; KF line 8
ARCDCT  SYN(B,25,1), (8)232547.0     ! landed p.291 line 27 VF,0; ST line 15 232547.00
YBCBU   SYN(BU), (8)231462.0         ! p.274 line 19 DR(BU),(15), as p.291's stand-in writes it
ALDBF   SYN,YBCBU                    ! landed p.291 line 33 SYN,YBCBU; VF line 28 ALDBF+13.32 = 231477.40
SCA8    SYN(BU,64,8), (8)230623.0    ! landed p.261 line 9 LI(BU,24) (full word) label; BD line 27 230623.04
ARNORM  SYN(BU,32,8), (8)235001.40   ! landed p.326 line 36 KV (half word) label; B line 16 235001.50
YRLLOG  SYN(BU,32,8), (8)235326.40   ! scratch p.333 line 6 LV (half word) label, spelled "YRLLCG" there; B lines 6, 11, 37 235326.50
YLJSLT  SYN(B,25,1), (8)235316.40    ! scratch p.332 line 49 VF,0; LF line 17 235316.40, LV line 31

        SLC, (8)235345.40
